      "writtenOn": "2022-09-29T19:16:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Many Thanks Dai on this info. Yes I did try emerge build which sets it to host. How about introducing a flag as part of thermal_config structure \"uint8_t custom_config\"?\n\n```\nstruct ec_thermal_config {\n        uint32_t temp_host[EC_TEMP_THRESH_COUNT]; /* levels of hotness */\n        uint32_t temp_host_release[EC_TEMP_THRESH_COUNT]; /* release levels */\n        uint32_t temp_fan_off; /* no active cooling needed */\n        uint32_t temp_fan_max; /* max active cooling needed */\n        uint8_t custom_config;\n} __ec_align4;\n```",
      "parentUuid": "15b7a0c1_8cd32181",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3278,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3280,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "2cbd209b6603e5568f030dbe74eb6d1994ab9c81",
